    "description": "\ud83c\udfb9 Easy Piano courses includes step-by-step tutorials with cute little songs. Let\u2019s saving your money and time by this mini virtual piano keyboards.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6<b>Easy Piano Keyboard with 6 key benefits</b>\ud83c\udfb6\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf8988-key piano keyboard\r\n\ud83c\udf89Easy piano tutor - Learn basic chords quickly\r\n\ud83c\udf89Multi-variable touch screen\r\n\ud83c\udf89Easy to adjust the width of the piano keyboard\r\n\ud83c\udf89ACC audio recording\r\n\ud83c\udf8910+ themes are ready to apply\r\n\r\n\u2757<b>How does Easy Piano App work?</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc47Open the piano keyboard and find your favorite piano sheet music & songs\r\n\ud83d\udc47Adjust the piano keyboard size, speed that suit you\r\n\ud83d\udc47Practice by the available song with easy piano tutor \r\n\ud83d\udc47Listening the audio recording and gradually improve your playing skills\r\n\ud83d\udc47Save and share your piano playing in ACC\r\n\r\nWith the Easy Piano Keyboard, you will have both interesting piano lessons and piano tutor. You will own a pro piano keyboards, powerful song recorder and smart auto piano tuner. Enjoy learning easy piano lesson with available piano sheet music. We provide basic keyboards tutor which is suitable for both beginners and advanced musicians, hope you enjoy the online piano keyboard! \r\n\r\n<b>Let\u2019s learn and create your own piano music</b> \ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6",
